<!doctype html>
<html lang="id"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="description" content="Laravel Route Viewer"><title>Laravel Route Viewer</title>@vite('resources/js/main.ts')</head><body>
<header><span class="brand"><b>03</b>DEVELOPER / TOOLS</span><div class="row"><span class="pill">RUANG KERJA LOKAL</span><button id="theme" aria-label="Ganti tema">Gelap</button></div></header>
<main><div class="intro"><div><div class="eyebrow">Alat pengembangan · 03 / 10</div><h1>Laravel Route Viewer</h1><p>Baca peta endpoint aplikasi Laravel dari data route yang Anda impor. Telusuri method, controller, dan middleware dalam satu tempat.</p></div><span class="tag">DIBUAT UNTUK BEKERJA.</span></div>
<div id="status" class="status" role="status" hidden></div>

<div class="workspace"><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><h2>01 / Sumber route</h2></div><div class="panel-body stack"><p class="muted">Jalankan perintah ini pada proyek sumber, lalu impor file hasilnya.</p><pre>php artisan route:list --json &gt; routes.json</pre><label>File routes.json<input id="file" type="file" accept=".json"></label><label>Atau tempel JSON<textarea id="source" class="code" placeholder="Tempel array hasil route:list…"></textarea></label><button id="import" class="primary">Baca route</button><div class="separator"></div><button id="local">Baca route aplikasi ini</button><small>Integrasi lokal hanya membaca aplikasi Route Viewer ini. Untuk proyek lain, impor data hasil Artisan dari proyek tersebut.</small></div></section>
<section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><h2>02 / Daftar route</h2><span class="pill" id="count">BELUM ADA DATA</span></div><div class="panel-body"><div class="toolbar"><label class="grow">Pencarian<input id="search" type="search" placeholder="URI, controller, nama, middleware…"></label><label>Method<select id="method"><option value="">Semua method</option><option>GET</option><option>POST</option><option>PUT</option><option>PATCH</option><option>DELETE</option><option>HEAD</option><option>OPTIONS</option></select></label><label>Prefix<select id="prefix"><option value="">Semua prefix</option></select></label></div><div class="row"><button id="json" disabled>Export JSON</button><button id="csv" disabled>Export CSV</button></div></div><div id="result" class="table-scroll"><div class="empty"><strong>Route dimulai dari sumber.</strong>Impor daftar route untuk menelusuri endpoint nyata.</div></div></section></div>
<footer class="note"><span>Laravel Route Viewer / AhmadNurHidayat-23</span><span>Data impor diproses di perangkat Anda.</span></footer></main></body></html>
